          <p class="sidebar-label">Built on Public Work</p>
          <div class="sidebar-version" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-72)">
            HGB's methods build on a decade of open hockey analytics: Evolving-Hockey, MoneyPuck, and HockeyViz (Micah McCurdy) on expected goals; hockeystats.com (JFresh and Patrick Bacon) and Evolving-Hockey on the WAR and RAPM framing; Natural Stat Trick on shot and rate-stat conventions; War-on-Ice on the original public xG. Where HGB lands differently, that's a deliberate design choice, not a disagreement about the craft.
